RangeAccrualNote::claim
├── given holder has balance for tokenId
│   ├── when growthInside and globalGrowth have both increased (price was in range)
│   │   ├── it returns the n/N ratio: (growthInside_delta / globalGrowth_delta).
│   │   └── it updates the holder's last claimed growth values.
│   ├── when globalGrowth increased but growthInside unchanged (price out of range)
│   │   └── it returns ratio of zero.
│   ├── when neither has changed (no blocks passed)
│   │   └── it returns zero.
│   └── when called twice consecutively without growth change
│       └── second call returns zero (idempotency).
├── given holder has zero balance for tokenId
│   └── it reverts.
└── given uninitialized tokenId (never minted)
    └── it reverts.
